  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2603.04 Failure to Post Bond. Any licensee who fails to file a bond pursuant to Saf-C 2603.02 and Saf-C 2603.03 shall be subject to a license revocation after notice and opportunity for a hearing.\n\nSource. #5752, eff 12-2-93; ss by INTERIM #7140, eff 12-2-99, EXPIRED: 3-31-00\n\nNew. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
